```{mermaid}
#| label: fig-flowchart
#| fig-cap: "Flowchart of participant sampling, exclusions, and biomarker analysis availability across time points (T0, T1, T2)."
flowchart TB
    A[Participants randomized<br/>n = ?] -->|Randomized| B[Blood samples collected<br/>at T0, T1, T2<br/>Total samples: 1,078]
    A -->|Excluded| X[Excluded from analysis<br/>n = 2<br/>Methylation values conflated<br/>Time points undifferentiated]

    B -->|Processed| C[Sequencing & quality control<br/>Loss to follow-up occurred]

    C -->|Analyzed| D1[BDNF analysis<br/>T0: 140<br/>T1: 122<br/>T2: 97<br/>Total: 359]
    C -->|Analyzed| D2[TAU analysis<br/>T0: 142<br/>T1: 123<br/>T2: 97<br/>Total: 362]
    C -->|Analyzed| D3[PSD95 analysis<br/>T0: 139<br/>T1: 122<br/>T2: 96<br/>Total: 357]

    %% Optional styling
    classDef exclude fill:#fff0f0,stroke:#c00,stroke-width:2px;
    classDef main fill:#f0f8ff,stroke:#0066cc;
    class A,B,C,D1,D2,D3 main;
    class X exclude;
```
